nts, passes through correspondent banks and cannot pay mobile money. ElementPay pays out on local rails, including mobile money, with the fee shown upfront.</p></div></div></section>\n<div style=\"background:#F6F4EF\">\n<section style=\"max-width:1240px;margin:0 auto;padding-left:clamp(20px,4vw,48px);padding-right:clamp(20px,4vw,48px);padding-top:clamp(64px,8vw,112px)\"><h2 style=\"font-family:var(--font-heading),sans-serif;font-size:clamp(28px, 1.5vw + 22px, 44px);line-height:.95;letter-spacing:-0.04em;font-weight:700;margin:0\">Side by side.</h2><div style=\"margin-top:32px;border-radius:24px;background:#fff;overflow-x:auto\"><table style=\"width:100%;min-width:600px;border-collapse:collapse;font-size:15px\"><thead><tr style=\"font-family:var(--font-label),monospace;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:.08em;color:#6E6C8A;text-align:left\"><th style=\"padding:18px 24px;font-weight:500;\"></th><th style=\"padding:18px 24px;font-weight:500;\">SWIFT WIRE</th><th style=\"padding:18px 24px;font-weight:500;color:#3B2ED3\">ELEMENTPAY</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr style=\"border-top:1px solid #EEEDE8\"><td style=\"padding:18px 24px;font-weight:600\">Delivery time</td><td style=\"padding:18px 24px;color:#6E6C8A\">2–5 business days</td><td style=\"padding:18px 24px;font-weight:600;color:#131126\">Seconds</td></tr><tr style=\"border-top:1px solid #EEEDE8\"><td style=\"padding:18px 24px;font-weight:600\">Weekends</td><td style=\"padding:18px 24px;color:#6E6C8A\">Not processed</td><td style=\"padding:18px 24px;font-weight:600;color:#131126\">Set by each local rail</td></tr><tr style=\"border-top:1px solid #EEEDE8\"><td style=\"padding:18px 24px;font-weight:600\">Intermediaries</td><td style=\"padding:18px 24px;color:#6E6C8A\">1–3 correspondent banks</td><td style=\"padding:18px 24px;font-weight:600;color:#131126\">None</td></tr><tr style=\"border-top:1px solid #EEEDE8\"><td style=\"padding:18px 24px;font-weight:600\">Fees</td><td style=\"padding:18px 24px;color:#6E6C8A\">Sender, intermediary and receiving fees</td><td style=\"padding:18px 24px;font-weight:600;color:#131126\">One fee, shown upfront</td></tr><tr style=\"border-top:1px solid #EEEDE8\"><td style=\"padding:18px 24px;font-weight:600\">Mobile money</td><td style=\"padding:18px 24px;color:#6E6C8A\">No</td><td style=\"padding:18px 24px;font-weight:600;color:#131126\">M-Pesa, MTN MoMo, Wave and more</td></tr><tr style=\"border-top:1px solid #EEEDE8\"><td style=\"padding:18px 24px;font-weight:600\">Stablecoin funding</td><td style=\"padding:18px 24px;color:#6E6C8A\">No</td><td style=\"padding:18px 24px;font-weight:600;color:#131126\">USDC and USDT</td></tr><tr style=\"border-top:1px solid #EEEDE8\"><td style=\"padding:18px 24px;font-weight:600\">Tracking</td><td style=\"padding:18px 24px;color:#6E6C8A\">Limited until it arrives</td><td style=\"padding:18px 24px;font-weight:600;color:#131126\">Webhook at every step</td></tr></tbody></table></div></section><section style=\"max-width:1240px;margin:0 auto;padding-left:clamp(20px,4vw,48px);padding-right:clamp(20px,4vw,48px);padding-top:clamp(64px,8vw,112px)\"><div style=\"display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(min(100%,320px),1fr));gap:12px;margin-top:32px\"><div style=\"padding:28px;border-radius:24px;background:#fff;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:12px;\"><span style=\"font-family:var(--font-label),monospace;font-size:12px;color:#6E6C8A\">WHEN A WIRE STILL MAKES SENSE</span><p style=\"font-size:15px;line-height:23px;color:#4C4A66;margin:0\">Very large one-off transfers between banks you already use, destinations outside ElementPay’s 20 payout countries, or when a counterparty insists on a SWIFT confirmation (MT103).</p></div><div style=\"padding:28px;border-radius:24px;background:#fff;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:12px;\"><span style=\"font-family:var(--font-label),monospace;font-size:12px;color:#3B2ED3\">WHEN ELEMENTPAY FITS</span><p style=\"font-size:15px;line-height:23px;color:#4C4A66;margin:0\">Regular business payments to Africa, paying many recipients, delivering to mobile money, funding from stablecoins, or needing an API and approvals.</p></div></div></section><section style=\"max-width:1240px;margin:0 auto;padding-left:clamp(20px,4vw,48px);padding-right:clamp(20px,4vw,48px);padding-top:clamp(64px,8vw,112px)\"><div style=\"display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(min(100%,340px),1fr));gap:clamp(24px,4vw,56px);align-items:start\"><h2 style=\"font-family:var(--font-heading),sans-serif;font-size:clamp(28px, 1.5vw + 22px, 44px);line-height:.95;letter-spacing:-0.04em;font-weight:700;margin:0\">Questions.</h2><div style=\"display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr);gap:8px;grid-column:span 2;min-width:0\"><details open=\"\" style=\"border-radius:20px;background:#fff\"><summary style=\"cursor:pointer;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;gap:16px;padding:22px 24px\"><h3 style=\"margin:0;font-size:17px;font-weight:500;line-height:24px\">How does ElementPay compare with a SWIFT bank wire?</h3><span style=\"width:30px;height:30px;border-radius:50%;background:#F6F4EF;display:grid;place-items:center;color:#3B2ED3;flex:none;font-size:18px\">+</span></summary><p style=\"margin:0;padding:0 24px 22px;font-size:16px;line-height:25px;color:#4C4A66\">A SWIFT wire works almost anywhere but often takes 2–5 business days to reach African bank accounts, passes through correspondent banks and cannot pay mobile money. ElementPay pays out on local rails, including mobile money, with the fee shown upfront.</p></details><details style=\"border-radius:20px;background:#fff\"><summary style=\"cursor:pointer;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;gap:16px;padding:22px 24px\"><h3 style=\"margin:0;font-size:17px;font-weight:500;line-height:24px\">Is ElementPay cheaper than a SWIFT wire?</h3><span style=\"width:30px;height:30px;border-radius:50%;background:#F6F4EF;display:grid;place-items:center;color:#3B2ED3;flex:none;font-size:18px\">+</span></summary><p style=\"margin:0;padding:0 24px 22px;font-size:16px;line-height:25px;color:#4C4A66\">ElementPay shows one fee and the exchange rate before you send, with no intermediary deductions. Whether it is cheaper depends on your bank’s fees and rate; compare the amount the recipient actually receives.</p></details><details style=\"border-radius:20px;background:#fff\"><summary style=\"cursor:pointer;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;gap:16px;padding:22px 24px\"><h3 style=\"margin:0;font-size:17px;font-weight:500;line-height:24px\">Which countries does ElementPay pay out to?</h3><span style=\"width:30px;height:30px;border-radius:50%;background:#F6F4EF;display:grid;place-items:center;color:#3B2ED3;flex:none;font-size:18px\">+</span></summary><p style=\"margin:0;padding:0 24px 22px;font-size:16px;line-height:25px;color:#4C4A66\">Kenya, Uganda, Tanzania, Rwanda, Ethiopia, Nigeria, Ghana, Senegal, Côte d’Ivoire, Benin, Togo, Burkina Faso, Mali, Cameroon, DR Congo, South Africa, Zambia, Malawi, Mozambique and Botswana.</p></details><details style=\"border-radius:20px;background:#fff\"><summary style=\"cursor:pointer;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;gap:16px;padding:22px 24px\"><h3 style=\"margin:0;font-size:17px;font-weight:500;line-height:24px\">Is ElementPay a bank?</h3><span style=\"width:30px;height:30px;border-radius:50%;background:#F6F4EF;display:grid;place-items:center;color:#3B2ED3;flex:none;font-size:18px\">+</span></summary><p style=\"margin:0;padding:0 24px 22px;font-size:16px;line-height:25px;color:#4C4A66\">No. ElementPay is a financial technology company. Banking services are provided by licensed partner institutions.</p></details></div></div></section><section style=\"max-width:1240px;margin:0 auto;padding-left:clamp(20px,4vw,48px);padding-right:clamp(20px,4vw,48px);padding-top:clamp(80px,10vw,140px)\"><div style=\"border-radius:28px;background:#3B2ED3;color:#fff;padding:clamp(36px,